      "mergedPostDetails": "\"Filter Group Locations\" button displays on all Social categories, e.g. in Offline users.\n\nIt should only display in Group Activity (Group Locations) category.\n\n-----\n\nThe list of groups to select/deselect in filters is partially broken:\n\nVideo: https://streamable.com/ytg5rb\n\nIt sometimes works and sometimes doesn't. \n\nE.g. Deselect a specific group and apply, the group instances will still show.\n\nE.g. Deselect all groups and apply, it won't show any instances, but every next time you click apply it will show them again, even tho no groups are selected.\n\nE.g. The number of instances on the list and in the header of \"Group Locations\" sometimes don't match up when these bugs happen.",
